config BR2_PACKAGE_SPIKE_VDEC
	bool "spike-vdec"
	help
	  R4 spike only: /usr/sbin/spike-vdec, H.264 decode on the video engine through the V4L2 stateless (request)
	  API (cedrus) with fps, CPU use and a bit-exact check, plus a CPU rotate estimate for the projection.
	  Plain C (the toolchain has no C++, so GStreamer's v4l2codecs and v4l-utils are out). The test clips are
	  made at build time (br-r4.sh) and copied in by post-build-r4.sh.
